abstract: >-
  LigQ2 is a modular framework for protein sequence-guided ligand
  prioritization and chemical retrieval. It integrates curated PDB- and
  ChEMBL-derived ligand evidence with sequence-based, nearest-neighbor,
  and domain-based candidate-protein strategies and supports compound
  prioritization from ZINC or user-provided chemical databases.

keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - ligand prioritization
  - protein sequence
  - molecular similarity
  - virtual screening
  - drug discovery

